New Year

Began with a resolution.
Mistakes returned as lessons.
Time brought back experience.

Some journeys ended,
New ones began.
Somewhere, characters changed.
Elsewhere, the story itself transformed.

Some decisions were right,
Others wrong.
Sometimes, there were regrets,
But often, there was peace.

From losing at times
To conquering the most.
From living in fear
To overcoming it.

From restless haste
To patient waiting.
And the cycle continues.